      "id": 4350522,
      "name": "[Blueprint] [Yanagi] Flowing Reflection - Lv.60",
      "desc": "This Blueprint can be used to unlock Yanagi's exclusive Tactical Prism crafting at the Smart Workshop. It can be purchased from Boojee's Store - Season Limited.\nItem Effect: When <color=#FFFFFF>Etheric Phantom</color> deals DMG to enemies, Tsukishiro Yanagi's Anomaly Buildup Rate increases by <color=#2BAD00>45%</color> for 60s; repeated triggers reset the duration.\nTsukishiro Yanagi can enter the <color=#FFFFFF>Shinrabanshou</color> state when she enters combat or when any squad member triggers the <color=#FFFFFF>Disorder</color> effect; repeated triggers reset the duration; while in the <color=#FFFFFF>Shinrabanshou</color> state, Tsukishiro Yanagi's <color=#2BAD00>Attribute Anomaly DMG and Disorder DMG increase by 60%</color>.",
